# Prompt Golf

This could be competitive in an almost speedrun sense.

Target:

> **Make the cowboy successfully marry the alien.**

Everyone has access to the same generation model.

Goal:

> Accomplish the target using the **fewest tokens**.

Example:

Player A:

> Cowboy romances alien convincingly.

4 words.

Player B:

> They marry.

2 words.

But maybe B fails because the generation doesn't establish the cowboy.

Now you're exploiting your understanding of the AI model.

That's literally **prompt golf**.

Leaderboard:

```text
THE DRAGON CRIES
World record: 3 words
```

People would discover and share clever solutions.

---

# Blind Prompting

Another one:

You're shown:

> Make this scene end happily.

But **you don't see the original scene**.

You enter:

> Everyone realizes the misunderstanding and hugs.

Then reveal:

It's three sharks eating a scuba diver.

Your solution gets applied anyway.

Very stupid. Potentially extremely funny.

