# Telephone is perfect for AI

Classic Telephone but multimodal.

Player A:

> writes a scene.

AI creates an image.

Player B sees only image → describes it.

AI creates video.

Player C sees only video → writes what happened.

AI generates a new image.

After 5 transformations:

> ORIGINAL vs FINAL

This has enormous shareability.

Could run asynchronously over a full day with each friend taking one turn.

