Every day the entire app gets one canonical scenario.

Like Wordle:

> **FREAK DAILY #184**
> The moon is falling toward Earth.
> Save humanity.

Everyone gets the same rules.

You only get **one official attempt**.

After submitting, you get a share card:

```text
