# Daily duel

Chess.com-style:

> You have 3 active games.

```text
SAM
Your turn
Constraint chain: 8

JOE
Waiting for Joe
Constraint chain: 14

ANNA
Your turn
Creature Battle
```

No need for everyone to be online.

This is extremely important because **party games normally die when the party ends**.

Freak Town wouldn't.

The party creates relationships/characters/rivalries.

Then those continue throughout the week through asynchronous challenges.

Then Friday night everyone gets back into Party Mode.

That's a genuinely strong retention loop:

```text
PARTY NIGHT
     ↓
characters / jokes / rivalries
     ↓
ASYNC CHALLENGES ALL WEEK
     ↓
streaks / mutations / duels
     ↓
NEW THINGS CREATED
     ↓
NEXT PARTY NIGHT
```

